{"id":"act33side_level_act33side_st01","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"avg_5_7_shining","fadetime":0,"screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_snowstormlp","loop":true,"channel":"bgs","volume":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"soundvolume","a":{"volume":0.6,"fadetime":3,"channel":"bgs"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A boy cries in his dreams. To weather the blizzard, a girl wraps him within her cloak, and wipes his tears away."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Freezing. Gusting. The air screams on."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Softly, the Cyclops tells of an epic tale. Far, far away..."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Through the snowstorm's seams, her voice comes."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The myriad souls' calls become harmony with it, the boy's whimpers the drum of their beat."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"This dream is bitter cold. Within, the girl seizes a faint breath. She covers the boy's eyes, and closes her own."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Even now, even here, for them, the ballad from a thousand years ago is still playing."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.6,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1","text":"......","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st2","text":"Armies fell upon our home; them I saw from afar,","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st3","text":"From valleys to hills, our lands they scarred.","x":300,"y":410,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st2"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st3"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st4","text":"The King slaughtered, the myriad souls did lament.","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st4"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st5","text":"Yet one sovereign fell, six heroes rose.","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st6","text":"They blew the horn, led the fight, faced their foes.","x":300,"y":410,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st5"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st6"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st7","text":"Alas, the wanderers' city collapsed,","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st8","text":"To ruin swift, as the fleeting peace elapsed.","x":300,"y":410,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st7","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st8","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1","text":"When all seemed lost, a black crown appeared,","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st2","text":"The twins brought hope where dread had reared.","x":300,"y":410,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st2"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st3","text":"Spreads the rift, giving birth to betrayal.","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st3"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st4","text":"An assassin in the heart of tempest; them I saw from afar,","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st5","text":"A sword to slay the regent king, a spear to pierce the royal ring.","x":300,"y":410,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st6","text":"Legend ends as justice calls. To righteous fate, the mighty falls.","x":300,"y":450,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st4","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st5","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st6","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"bgs","fadetime":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"'That is how this episode ends.'"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The Cyclops fades into the blizzard of the dreamscape, leaving the child behind her."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The boy's own cries grow distant from his ears."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"He wakes."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_thundercloud","screenadapt":"coverall","xscale":1,"yscale":1,"x":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"backgroundtween","a":{"xfrom":0,"xto":20,"xscalefrom":1,"yscalefrom":1,"xscaleto":1.1,"yscaleto":1.1,"duration":30,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Summer, 1094"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Outskirts of an abandoned town, Kazdel"},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"That is how this episode ends, Ascalon. My story is over."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"That is what my people... the Cyclopes bound for the deep north, saw as they gazed their last of Kazdel."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Was that a page from long-lost history? A possible future yet to come...? Or plain meaningless gibbering?"},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"None knew for the past millennium..."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Until they came, and fate's rapids begin to narrow, into a surer course..."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"And now, the fate she saw has drawn before our eyes."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_laccolith","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"I don't care."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1294_1#2$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"*cough* I'm surprised you'd even hear me out."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Bright red blood creeps along his mask, trickling down his chest."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Ascalon's eyes narrow a hair. He's out of luck."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"You're about to die. So I gave you one last token of respect."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"*cough*... *hack*..."},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Those prophecies never did gnaw at you, in all the time we knew each other, no?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#3$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"That's why you will never understand... how a greedy soul thirsts to control his fate."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"Choose better last words."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"I know how you hurry to convene with those Babel members. But it's not yet time for you to leave. Look—the Catastrophe is near."},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Ah... Funny, I'm curious now."},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"What was it you found... within the storm?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"Step aside."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"'No commission left unfinished.' The rule I set myself back when I was at the Scar Market."},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Alive, or—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_clothmovementsp"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":0.3,"afrom":1,"ato":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.31}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_cnstrctnck"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","action":"shake","power":10,"times":50,"duration":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","focus":"right"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Urgh!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.15,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":3,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A dawn-like mist is wound about the Cyclops's neck as Ascalon vanishes behind him, leaving his body to dangle over the cliff's edge."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"You ever seen your own end, then?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1294_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"I don't care for prophecies. We have that in common, hah."},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"But fact is, none of us can outrun fate. Don't you want to struggle out of it? What makes you not? Why can you not? How can you not?"},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Never forget, you have your place in the prophecies too—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Whimpering. Storming."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A plaintive chant rings in their ears, an elegy o'er the horizon from the Convallis of the Banshees, sucked into the storm's eye."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Ascalon gives an involuntary shudder. She is ice cold from head to toe."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"An indescribable pain rips from behind her ears down to the soles of her feet."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"This nameless elegy. This ill omen."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ascalon","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1294_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"Farewell... Kazdel."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A single sigh reaches Ascalon."},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_cnstrctnck"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Her hand tightens fast, until not even the faintest sound will leave Scareye's throat again."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"And then, she lets go."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":15,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_clothmovementsp"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"line","name":"Scareye","text":"...Hah—damned fate."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"In a blink, the tremendous figure of the Cyclops becomes no more than a speck below the overhang."},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_wind"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The mist scatters to the storm. The shadow of a hood goes with it. All vanishes within the teardrops falling from the cliff."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Gasps. Rolls of thunder from Catastrophe clouds. Whistles as the sand is swept across the barrens..."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The sound of everything culminates in silence."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_victoria","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Londinium, Victoria"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","duration":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Now..."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Lift your heads, Sarkaz of hers."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"If you would still see through the calling she bestowed you, here I stand. Come, step forth."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"You may avenge her."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":1,"afrom":1,"ato":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"My name is stitched onto my clothes."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#6$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"Stitched by Her Highness Theresa's own hands. I can feel it faintly burning right this moment, and I know... what that means."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"The mission she assigned us is over."},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"We'll clash with you no more. The Sarkaz do not draw on each other before the invader."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#4$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"We—pledge our loyalty to you, Regent."},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"So long as you still hold your zeal and earnestness for the Sarkaz, we will trust you with our lives."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Manfred","text":"Even though you nearly ruined all the plans we'd set up in Victoria?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#4$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"Should the Military Commission put us to death, we will be willing to die."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#3$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"As long as it could bring a better end..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"An end as she wished."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Manfred","text":"A moment ago, you were the renegades-in-chief, all but ready to entomb our plans. How can I possibly believe—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Manfred."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#3$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Manfred","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#3$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"'As she wished', you said."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Your name, deathmonger."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Assassin","text":"Julie."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"I will remember it. And I will hand you your final mission."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Guards, assassins, mercenaries, survivors of this sea of bloodshed one and all—you are to enter the Mausoleum of Kings."},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"You are to render Victoria's iron heart as scrap. You are to ambush and wipe out every last Steam Knight."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"You'd let us take part in the Commission's core plan to enfeeble Londinium?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"Manfred will take good care of you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#3$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"There's no chance we leave that place alive, is there?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"You're welcome to fight for it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"Very well."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","focus":"all"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"...What's keeping you here?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"I'm just taking it in. I'm looking at the one who fostered Ascalon."},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"She never rid herself of you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#3$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Theresis","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1299_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"I swore to follow Her Highness Theresa, with no inkling that the tale of the mixed-blood twins, rewriters of Kazdel's history, would end this way."},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"Let alone that this disposable life of mine had a place in it."},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"Farewell, Your Highness Theresis."},{"t":"line","name":"Julie","text":"I take my hatred of you to the grave."},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_corridor_2","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Rhodes Island 